# SvelteKit conventions

- Prefer **reusable components** in `app-svelte/src/lib/components/` when UI/logic is duplicated.
- Keep components small; extract modals/popups/list items into their own files.
- Reset modal `$state` when popups close (state persists across open/close cycles).
- Update `docs/refactor-frontend.md` for meaningful frontend changes (what/why/impact).

